        "title": {
          "type": "text",
          "$t": "Android Studio Quail 3 Patch 1 now available"
        },
        "content": {
          "type": "html",
          "$t": "\n<p>Android Studio Quail 3 Patch 1 is now available in the Stable channel.</p>\n\n<p>If you already have an Android Studio build on the&nbsp;<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/studio/intro/update.html#channels\">Stable channel</a>,\nyou can get the update by clicking <b>Help</b>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<b>Check for Updates</b> (or <b>Android Studio</b>&nbsp;&gt;&nbsp;<b>Check\nfor Updates</b> on macOS). Otherwise, you can <a href=\"https://developer.android.com/studio\">download it here</a>.</p>\n\n<p>For information on new features and changes in Android Studio Quail 3, see the&nbsp;<a\nhref=\"https://developer.android.com/studio/releases\"\n>Android Studio release notes</a>.\n\nFor details of bugs fixed in each previous release of Android Studio Quail 3, see\n<a href=\"https://developer.android.com/studio/releases/fixed-bugs/studio/2026.1.3.html\">closed issues</a>.</p>\n\n"
        },
